      "created_at": "2018-01-13T09:47:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, you'll still get Bringer's special-rule Fear for anything you <em>would</em> have destroyed, which is more than any other spirit gets for destroying stuff anyway. So it's not as if you lose out - quite the opposite, really ;).</p>",
