      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-01-14T10:29:31.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I suppose it depends how much stuff you destroy - Bringer generates more Fear for destroying buildings than the other spirits do (two for Towns and five for Cities, versus one and two for everyone else), plus gets to Push them somewhere. So if you were playing with, say, Ocean, and pushed them into the sea you'd get some Fear for Ocean subsequently eating everything (since that's Ocean doing the destroying, not Bringer) &gt;:).</p>",
